From: tbrasselle <tbrasselle@gmail.com>
Date: Sun, 22 Nov 2026 12:54:23 -0500
Subject: [PATCH] refactor(multiaxis): split first_traverse.rs along the domain
 seam

Move the 3+2 tilted-table reading (#2987, #3081: tilting_all,
work_tilts, table_top_face, TableRead, table_read, TABLE_UNJUDGED_NOTE
and the catalog table test) into the new sibling module
first_traverse_table.rs. first_traverse.rs is 320 lines, inside the
400-line limit; the moved items are re-exported from first_traverse, so
the public API stays stable. No behaviour change.

#[test] count in camcraft-app: 4324 before, 4324 after.

Fixes #3288
